 "description": "BIGVILLE R8 (block 256000) -- the LIFE-GOAL layer (identity / soul). gg_lifegoal_grounded affirms a life-goal is GROUNDED (carries a real `path_to` in the map-belief -- the grounded side of the boundary), one-shot via a grounded_flag done-guard. gg_orient_choice is G-life-goal-orients: the sub-goal SELECTION is the substrate's decision_value Argmax (the SAME family as R2 nd_choose_good / the drama's ss_choose_burn) over the soul's `considers` options of base_appeal + Sum_{has_life_goal}[serves_aim==aim ? orient_weight : 0]. A become-wealthy life-goal (high orient_weight on the SAVE aim) tips a lower-base-appeal SAVE above a higher-base-appeal LEISURE; ABLATE the life-goal (drop the has_life_goal edge) -> the Sum is empty -> base appeal decides -> LEISURE wins -> no long-horizon bias (load-bearing). Composes existing Terms; zero new Rust.",
